00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:33.450
<v Ike Sriskandarajah>If you want to see Pablo's paintings or follow his campaign for Standing Committee, he's at Pablo.Manriquez on Instagram.
<v Ike Sriskandarajah>如果你想看巴勃罗的画或者关注他竞选常设委员会，请访问Instagram上的Pablo.Manriquez。

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:39.090
