00:55:47.660 --> 00:56:00.160
<v Ike Sriskandarajah>Thanks, as always, to our boss, Ira Glass. You know, at his own wedding recently, he decided it would be funny to start his vows by saying, "it's This American Wife." Nobody laughed.
<v Ike Sriskandarajah>一如既往地感谢我们的老板艾拉·格拉斯。你知道，在他最近自己的婚礼上，他决定以说“这是《美国生活》的妻子”来开始他的誓言，这会很有趣。结果没人笑。

00:56:00.160 --> 00:56:05.780
<v Daniel Alarcón>It was just beginning to dawn on me that this was the wrong way to start my marriage.
<v Daniel Alarcón>我开始意识到这是开始我婚姻的错误方式。

00:56:05.780 --> 00:56:10.780
<v Ike Sriskandarajah>I'm Ike Sriskandarajah. Ira Glass will be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ike Sriskandarajah>我是艾克·斯里斯坎达拉贾。艾拉·格拉斯下周将带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
